An '''enchanting table''' is a [[block]] used to spend [[experience]] and [[lapis lazuli]] to apply [[enchantment]]s to [[tool]]s, [[armor]] and [[Enchanted Book|books]]. Surrounding it with up to fifteen [[bookshelves]] increases both its enchanting power and [[level]] requirement.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
An enchanting table requires a [[pickaxe]] to be mined, in which case it drops itself. If mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.
