'''Dripstone block''' is a [[rock]] block that allows [[pointed dripstone]] to grow beneath it if there is [[water]] on top of it.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
A dripstone block requires a [[pickaxe]] to be mined, in which case it drops itself. When mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.

{{breaking row|Dripstone Block|pickaxe|wooden|horizontal=1}}

=== Natural generation ===
{{main|Dripstone (feature)}}
Dripstone blocks can be found in [[dripstone caves]]. They can generate on the floor, the ceiling, as [[Dripstone (feature)|stalactites]], stalagmites, or stalagnates (joined stalactite and stalagmite). They can generate [[Water|underwater]].

{{block distribution}}

